MuReg Rigid Registration

This distribution contains unmodified Python source files from:
Initial_Registration, https://github.com/dalbenzioG/Initial_Registration
Upstream commit: 21ee6ceb50bdb1e8d14072cb54ebb1bd2c611029
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (included as LICENSE).
Original authors retain their rights in the upstream work.

The src/pca_icp package contains the original mesh-processing, PCA-frame,
candidate-scoring, transformation and ICP utilities. UPSTREAM.json records the
vendored file hashes. Other upstream registration modes are not distributed.

The src/mureg_rigid package is an adaptation. Its changes include MuReg NIfTI
preprocessing and resampling, 24 proper PCA-axis correspondences selected by
minimum rotation angle, rotation-vector damping, a post-registration rotation
gate, and evaluation/command-line wrappers. It does not execute the original
end-to-end candidate-scoring and conditional multistart pipeline.


TCIA workflow integration
-------------------------

TCIA Prostate Rigid

Contains primitives from Initial_Registration:
https://github.com/dalbenzioG/Initial_Registration
Commit: 21ee6ceb50bdb1e8d14072cb54ebb1bd2c611029
License: Apache License 2.0 (included as LICENSE).
Original authors retain their rights. UPSTREAM.json lists exact vendored hashes.

The six primitive modules under tcia_prostate_rigid/_vendor/pca_icp are
unmodified. Its initializer is replaced, and the upstream full registration
pipeline is not included. TCIA-specific adapters, 24 proper PCA-axis candidates
selected by minimum rotation, rotation-vector damping, NRRD/NIfTI handling,
physical-mm resampling, verification, metrics, resumable exports and interfaces
are adaptations. This package does not reproduce the upstream candidate-scoring
or conditional multistart pipeline.

Eigen Artemis DICOM geometry follows SlicerHeart DicomUltrasoundPlugin:
https://github.com/SlicerHeart/SlicerHeart
STL coordinate handling follows explicit SPACE metadata or Slicer default LPS.
This project is not an official TCIA or 3D Slicer distribution.

